    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "program_body",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 122,
      "width": 248,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "• Poseidon hash verification\n• Merkle inclusion proof\n• STARK ECDSA signature check\n• STARK curve ECDH binding\n• State transition logic\n• Commitment computation\n\nassert(all constraints pass)\n→ if any fails, no proof",
      "originalText": "• Poseidon hash verification\n• Merkle inclusion proof\n• STARK ECDSA signature check\n• STARK curve ECDH binding\n• State transition logic\n• Commitment computation\n\nassert(all constraints pass)\n→ if any fails, no proof",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
